invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the configuration hash leaves out the SPKI pins, so a ticket issued
  under one pin set resumes under another, and a resumed handshake
  checks no key against the new pins. The pin-set row objects.

--- old
    hash_len(&s, cfg->spki_pin_count);
    for (size_t i = 0; i < cfg->spki_pin_count; i++) {
        sha256_update(&s, cfg->spki_pins[i], SHA256_LEN);
    }
--- new
    (void)cfg->spki_pins;
